+    # after the whole eval loop finishes, so without this a deadline would cost not
+    # just the remaining episodes but every episode already completed. The driver
+    # flushes each row as it goes, so a partial JSONL is a valid partial result.
+    # Uploaded under a distinct prefix: rescued data is truncated by definition and
+    # must never be mistaken for a completed run.
